n$$\n\nSeeking a non-zero solution of $(B-5I)x=0$ gives us the eigenvector ${v}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}.$\n\n- For ${\\lambda }_{2}=-3,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}B-(-3)I & =\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 4 & 1 \\\\ 4 & 4 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 5\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSeeking a non-zero solution of $(B-(-3)I)x=0$ gives us the eigenvector ${v}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}.$\n\n- For ${\\lambda }_{3}=2,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}B-2I & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 4 & 1 \\\\ 4 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSeeking a non-zero solution of $(B-2I)x=0$ gives us the eigenvector ${v}_{3}=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix}.$\n\n**Step 3.** We construct the diagonal matrix $D$ and the invertible matrix $P$ in the usual way, and this gives us the following:\n\n$$\nD=\\begin{bmatrix}5 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -3 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 2\\end{bmatrix},\\,P=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -1 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 1 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 3\\end{bmatrix}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186354312 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1a5e97c5-f73a-5dc7-aca2-86493283b121" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$D=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}$\nand\n$P=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 6 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1\\end{bmatrix}$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186351803} {:answer/id #uuid "259df9a5-e148-52b1-8c76-e5f3797156f6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$D=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}$\nand\n$P=\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1\\end{bmatrix}$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186351913} {:answer/id #uuid "6a0b1af0-e162-51c8-a699-561daf399c7d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$A$ is not diagonalizable" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186352507} {:answer/id #uuid "90343dd9-95c9-5f79-b6c6-c97b7b8b1870" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$D=\\begin{bm