sents the linear transformation $T$, where\n$T: \\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}⟶\\begin{bmatrix}y - x \\\\ y + x\\end{bmatrix}$."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186253647 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0cb554c0-30a6-58ba-b55e-b7007fa86faf" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186250660} {:answer/id #uuid "14454ad5-218e-510b-b45e-8ee7d671319a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186250728} {:answer/id #uuid "149bbf87-554e-585d-950e-a17b853a680e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186250733} {:answer/id #uuid "3a82f88c-a7db-5ed3-a3fd-d6c151b82641" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186251039} {:answer/id #uuid "7742134b-9e80-561f-b100-084ecbbbd3f8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186251538}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186251039} :answer-field/id #uuid "fa783422-312d-54af-a3e7-0dcb6bfbb45c" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186253246}] :question/id #uuid "f5d2b89d-649f-58f6-8911-6e694e8c52ce" :question/math-academy-id "q-12011" :question/problem "Find the standard matrix that represents  the  linear  transformation  $T$, where\n\n$$\nT:\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}⟶\\begin{bmatrix}y-3x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, rewrite the order of the variables in the usual way:\n\n$$\nT:\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}⟶\\begin{bmatrix}-3x+y \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nWe require a $2\\times 2$ matrix $T$ such that\n    \n\n$$\nT\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-3x+y \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nNotice that\n    \n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-3x+y \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\n    Therefore, the matrix which represents the linear transformation  $T$ is\n    \n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186292875 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4a49ef66-0556-5a75-ac60-36d8d9881cf3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186290945}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186290945} :answer-field/id #uuid "2f37210c-42b9-5d74-9b6e-6ad727542620" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186291895} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "fa8504e6-81e0-5e12-8e91-3544ca94536e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186291693}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186291693} :answer-field/id #uuid "4152b98d-a121-588c-9f7e-b55345c8340d" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186291950} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2c35d273-47bd-5c17-a9da-c2f55dae0611" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186290808}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186290808} :answer-field/id #uuid "70a5e017-0e41-5b85-88dc-342686a32f68" :answer-field/key "field-4" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186292078} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1f