bmatrix}⟶\\begin{bmatrix}7x-5y \\\\ -4x+2y\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nWe require a $2\\times 2$ matrix $T$ such that\n    \n\n$$\nT\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}7x-5y \\\\ -4x+2y\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nNotice that\n    \n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}7 & -5 \\\\ -4 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}7x-5y \\\\ -4x+2y\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\n    Therefore, the matrix which represents the linear transformation $T$ is\n    \n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}7 & -5 \\\\ -4 & 2\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299568 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "644578fd-031f-5c1e-aa14-f50d2433a407" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297979}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297979} :answer-field/id #uuid "0e3d2502-8f4f-54d1-af06-b2a681c22052" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298687} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "94a19f5b-18f1-572f-91b9-76c0e4a83166" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298193}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298193} :answer-field/id #uuid "2893a8d9-1f3f-5bb0-bcbe-52d4cab33de5" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298774} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5b5e2fa7-4bb3-58b5-a6c8-c645a5884eba" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297936}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297936} :answer-field/id #uuid "8d3d2da8-d046-5d46-80b1-ff6a664cdca8" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 175