ral vector $\\,\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix}.$ Multiplying by the matrix $T,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}T\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 2 & 5 \\\\ 4 & 0 & -3 \\\\ 2 & 1 & 6\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-x+2y+5z \\\\ 4x-3z \\\\ 2x+y+6z\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the linear transformation $\\,T\\,$ is given by\n\n$$\nT:\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix}⟶\\begin{bmatrix}-x+2y+5z \\\\ 4x-3z \\\\ 2x+y+6z\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299557 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "be574714-0336-5cb9-8d2d-c8a674380580" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2x-y+4z" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298388}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2x-y+4z" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298388} :answer-field/id #uuid "68bf4be2-555f-534d-a44b-e44c96ca825a" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298989} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "996c0f66-4c76-5873-8c09-4b06a9600de9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5x+3y-2z" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298216}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5x+3y-2z" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298216} :answer-field/id #uuid "95c75e76-ac39-59e5-94c9-ef3b245f4b62" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299131} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "732cfac4-03a9-52b5-a772-d5748126c49f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x-6y+7z" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298051}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x-6y+7z" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298051} :answer-field/id #uuid "d29d46cc-9716-597e-9f9e-2d9cb286d5cd" :answer-field/key "field-3" :a